      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minster%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village began as Stallostown in 1832, founded by Francis J. Stallo, who died in 1833.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
