      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minster%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A 19‑mile railroad branch opened in 1878, linking Minster to northern towns until the 1930s when cars took over.",
